WEBVTT

00:23:29.606 --> 00:23:32.240
and seeing it as something
only young people can master,

00:23:32.264 --> 00:23:34.285
she went straight to the experts she knew.

00:23:34.309 --> 00:23:38.374
LS: My students helped me
to figure out Instagram and Snapchat,

00:23:38.398 --> 00:23:42.982
and I started to take classes

00:23:43.006 --> 00:23:49.347
in social media and fashion
and just random things,

00:23:49.371 --> 00:23:52.129
like, how to start your own vintage store.

00:23:52.816 --> 00:23:54.787
AG: In a study in the fashion industry,

00:23:54.811 --> 00:23:57.386
the more time designers
and directors spend abroad,

00:23:57.410 --> 00:24:00.371
the more creative they became
over their careers,